20
00:00:42,033 --> 00:00:43,233
You must have misheard

21
00:00:43,866 --> 00:00:44,900
50,000 to buy into the business

22
00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:45,966
Dream on

23
00:00:47,233 --> 00:00:47,600
Brother-in-law

24
00:00:47,833 --> 00:00:49,033
I want to use my family's

25
00:00:49,033 --> 00:00:50,100
