80
00:02:36,233 --> 00:02:36,900
30,000 a year

81
00:02:37,100 --> 00:02:37,700
Non-negotiable

82
00:02:38,233 --> 00:02:38,700
I'll take it

83
00:02:38,833 --> 00:02:39,600
Let's sign the contract now
